emporary failure, but they also repeat work and add load. Treat each retry as a deliberate decision based on the failure, the job's deadline, and the safety of its effect."}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"classify-failures-before-setting-a-policy","children":"Classify failures before setting a policy"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"For an export worker, distinguish:"}],"\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a"],false]}]]}],"$L2b"]}]}]
